From 14cadc10ed28672c0976fb073a63814734e81fb6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Portal <masobazee@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 04:29:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] backends/anland: Add the Portal Stylus tablet tool

Android's stylus reaches KWin as a zwp_tablet_v2 tablet tool with
pressure, tilt, hover distance, the eraser end and both barrel buttons.

A pen sample is two input events that fit the 16-byte payload:
INPUT_TYPE_TABLET_TOOL_AXES (15) latches tilt and distance, and
INPUT_TYPE_TABLET_TOOL (16) commits position, pressure and state flags.
The host sends absolute state; proximity, tip and button transitions are
derived here, so a dropped host event cannot leave the pen stuck down.
